# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Brain Slice 9 integrated-mind question routes. These explicit
# operators keep new selfhood, proposition, provenance, and
# counterfactual questions inside Soar decision selection rather
# than dropping them into generic fallback speech.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

sp {yala*propose*contact*slice8*autobiographical-memory
   (state <s> ^superstate nil ^io.input-link <in>)
   (<in> ^world-input <w>)
   (<w> ^contact yes ^speech-act question ^topic autobiographical-memory)
-->
